{"version":1,"content":"<p>周五，SpaceX完成星艦關鍵試飛，但未能回收火箭的兩級箭體。火箭於當地時間下午4時47分（美國東部時間下午5時47分）從公司位於德克薩斯州南部的發射場升空。<strong>SpaceX原本計劃捕獲並復用助推器，該計劃被迫取消，助推器轉而受控濺落墨西哥灣，並在海面起火。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586368.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.178484+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:52:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"3809eeff9fcd4f032a5e511bd1e4a1aa0e461fcd230ef4a904f5080b7e8897ea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}